{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdZ9tmexcqyFurwVRAc4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"DoorDash CEO Tony Xu told analysts on the company's third-quarter earnings call that third-party AI agents such as Muse, Instinct and Fo have placed \"maybe several hundred orders in total\" on the platform. For scale, DoorDash said in its 2025 report that it completes an average of 3 million deliveries a day. The two figures cover different time frames, so they aren't a precise ratio. Still, the gap is large, and Xu said customers are still predominantly ordering through DoorDash's own app.\n\nXu described agent ordering as \"a very dynamic area\" and said, \"you never want to fight gravity. But at the same time, you don't want to be delusional.\" That caution sits alongside a good deal of building. DoorDash launched a chatbot called Ask DoorDash in June that takes orders from prompts and photos. It added a CLI agent in July and a text-to-order agent in September. It has also released an MCP so corporate customers can order through other chatbots. The company says it wants a healthy relationship with outside agent makers, and Xu mentioned a possible future opportunity to advertise inside those agents.\n\nThe several-hundred figure applies only to third-party agents. The article doesn't say how many orders DoorDash's own agents have handled. What the number measures is how little traffic outside assistants are sending to DoorDash today. That is a narrower question than whether people want to order food by prompt at all.\n\nWhether that number grows depends partly on access decisions that platforms are still making. Amazon has been blocking personal shopping agents. Walmart has welcomed them as a way to win business from competitors. DoorDash's stated approach of courting agent makers while building its own tools puts it closer to Walmart's side for now. It is making that bet on volume that, by its CEO's account, barely registers yet."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2078,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2078},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5d7404ba-cdf5-40e4-80bf-3fd8fd336af1","uuid":"2c9a3a23-0f29-4abd-af22-8c7a9395f72f","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:33:10.983Z","request_id":"req_011CgdZ9tGtYBcYqewk2vkLz"}
